{"4861710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Treasure Chest Master", "steam_appid": 4861710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4866550], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought about who collects chests for heroes? No, they don't appear on their own, each of the chests has its own Master! Immerse yourself in the story of the Chest Master, in which your job is to fill chests with loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are the new Dungeon Master who has to fill the chests for the heroes from above. But is everything so smooth in this job? Solve the mystery of this corporation and decide whether you want to continue working for it or change the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, your tasks are:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill chests with loot from fallen heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repaint things depending on the desired rarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the history of the past Master of Chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform the secondary tasks of the Work Master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics that you will need to master as a Master:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extracting items from carts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brewing rare potions in a cauldron</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain the reputation of the Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with completing orders before the timer expires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of the heroes depends on you, don't let them down! Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861710/extras/ad93dc86680754732242e502693ae249.poste